[en.FOCUS_C14_TRADE_AGREEMENT]
Trade Agreement

[en.FOCUS_C14_TRADE_AGREEMENT_desc]
At first glance, this is a quite confusing trade aggreement, as both Ponyville and Appleloosa has a economic structure based on agriculture — They seem more like competitors rather than partners.\nHowever, the trade agreement was made in the Summer of 1001, right after the “Peaceful Coup” in Appleloosa and before the Summer Offensive led by Cozy Glow against Crystal Empire.\nIf you consider the political situation at that time, it all makes sense: the Equestria Empire is in war with the Crystal Empire, and what it needs is a stable supply of food, as well as a stable south.\nThe trade agreement is a win-win-win situation: Appleloosa got a guaranteed market for its apples, Ponyville got the arbitrage gain as a dealer between Appleloosa and central Equestria, and the Equestria Empire got its supply.\nActually, all parties involved in the agreement benefited more than what they seem to be getting: Braeburn got his new position secured, Trixie got her promotion to temporary district head, and Cozy Glow got her fresh hot apple pie — a rare delicacy later in the cold snowy land of the Crystal Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_TRADE_AGREEMENT]
贸易协定

[zh.FOCUS_C14_TRADE_AGREEMENT_desc]
乍一看，这个贸易协定似乎是一个相当令人困惑的协定，因为无论是小马谷还是苹果鲁萨都是以农业为基础的经济结构——他们看起来更像是竞争者而不是合作伙伴。\n然而，这个贸易协定是在1001年夏天制定的，正好是在苹果鲁萨的“和平政变”之后，以及和煦光流对水晶帝国的夏季攻势之前。\n如果你考虑当时的政治局势，这一切都说得通：小马利亚帝国正在与水晶帝国交战，它需要的是稳定的食物供应，以及一个稳定的南部。\n这个贸易协定是一个三赢的局面：苹果鲁萨得到了苹果的有保障的销售市场，小马谷得到了作为苹果鲁萨和中央小马利亚之间的交易商的差价，而小马利亚帝国得到了它的补给。\n事实上，协议中涉及的所有各方都得到了比他们看起来得到的更多的利益：布雷本得到了他新地位的保障，崔克西得到了她的临时区长晋升，而和煦光流得到了新鲜的热苹果派——后来在水晶帝国的寒冷雪地里难得的美味。

